  cyclic gaps: [14, 14, 14, 14, 14, 14, 14, 14, 14, 14, 14, 1, 28]   max gap=28/183=0.1530  (2h=1/7=0.1429)
  min ||phase||: 14/183  (= M(DW)*Phi6 = numerator of M)
  Eisenstein short reps (norm, x, y) of each phase residue  [norm ~ (dist*Phi6)^2 scale]:
    r= 14: N=    1  (  0+  1 omega)
